{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1502612-mexico-and-spain-in-requiem","id":1502612,"title":"Mexico and Spain in Requiem","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-02-09T10:13:10-08:00","id":1502612,"title":"Mexico and Spain in Requiem","content":"Hello fellow Requiem enjoyers !<br /> <br /> Can you share with me your knowledge (and sources) about Mexico and Spain in Requiem ?<br /> <br /> I'll be GMing a Chronicle for my GF and since she is from Mexico, I'd love to add some nods to her country's depiction during my campaign and I think that Spain would naturally have to be considered in relation to Mexico, since Vampires are long lived creatures with equally as long grudges.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1233-ur-than","name":"Ur-Than","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-09T10:44:42-08:00","id":1502615,"title":"","content":"Okay, just top of my head:<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Vampire the Requiem 1e - Shadows of Mexico. </b>All Mexico related things there, the most in-game authoritative source for lore and 1ed rules (not that hard to convert to 2e).<br /> <br /> Tangencial references also on <b>Vampire the Requiem 1e - New Orleans - City the Damned. </b>A very small set of content mentioning Colonial times, and some characters (Augusto Vidal and Philip Maldonato) background is from Spain.<br /> <br /> <b>Mage the Awakeing 2e - Core</b> has a \u200breference to Salamanca, Spain, very mage focused but can give you ideas what the other supers do when in power.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-09T10:55:16-08:00","id":1502616,"title":"","content":"Thanks !<br /> <br /> In a sense, little informations means more freedom but I may track down Shadows of Mexico !","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1233-ur-than","name":"Ur-Than","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-09T13:53:44-08:00","id":1502639,"title":"","content":"It depends if you are looking for fan-writting supplements and if you can read Spanish. Vampire: The Requiem has two fan supplements from <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/requiem.nocte/\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Requiem Nocte</i></a> and <i>Biblioteca de Cartago</i>. They have the <i>Reinos de Sangre - Espa\u00f1a</i> and <i>Tierra de Condenados - Espa\u00f1a</i>, two huge sourcebooks about Spain (410 and 232 pages, respectively) and two city books <i>Ciudad de Condenados - Barcelona </i>and <i>Ciudad de Condenados - Valencia.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27293,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27293-cabaal","user":"Cabaal","date":". 04-23-2023, 02:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27293-cabaal","name":"Cabaal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27293_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-09T16:07:45-08:00","id":1502653,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1177930-ceceya-and-shadows-of-mexico\">This</a> thread has some discussion of both the book and some other Mexico-related bits. Possibly worth checking out for the book references and hooks at least.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-10T02:49:10-08:00","id":1502682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cabaal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1502612-mexico-and-spain-in-requiem?p=1502639#post1502639\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It depends if you are looking for fan-writting supplements and if you can read Spanish. Vampire: The Requiem has two huge fan supplements from <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/requiem.nocte/\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Requiem Nocte</i></a> and <i>Biblioteca de Cartago</i>. They have the <i>Reinos de Sangre - Espa\u00f1a</i> and <i>Tierra de Condenados - Espa\u00f1a</i>, two huge sourcebooks about Spain (410 and 232 pages, respectively) and two city books <i>Ciudad de Condenados - Barcelona </i>and <i>Ciudad de Condenados - Valencia.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks a lot !<br /> <br /> Well, I can read a little bit in Spanish, so I've dowloaded the books, will see how it goes haha !<br /> <br /> Edit : having looked it over I most certainly wished we would get more REquiem book about some regions of the world or even some Bloodlines from 1ed !","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1233,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1233-ur-than","user":"Ur-Than","date":". 02-10-2023, 01:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1233-ur-than","name":"Ur-Than","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-13T22:06:39-08:00","id":1502999,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cabaal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1502612-mexico-and-spain-in-requiem?p=1502639#post1502639\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It depends if you are looking for fan-writting supplements and if you can read Spanish. Vampire: The Requiem has two huge fan supplements from <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/requiem.nocte/\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Requiem Nocte</i></a> and <i>Biblioteca de Cartago</i>. They have the <i>Reinos de Sangre - Espa\u00f1a</i> and <i>Tierra de Condenados - Espa\u00f1a</i>, two huge sourcebooks about Spain (410 and 232 pages, respectively) and two city books <i>Ciudad de Condenados - Barcelona </i>and <i>Ciudad de Condenados - Valencia.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>I was able to download Tierra de Condenados and Barcelona, but not the other two. Any way you could share then in private?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27429-microcuchon","name":"Microcuchon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-13T23:29:53-08:00","id":1503001,"title":"","content":"I actually couldn't find Barcelona &gt;&lt;<br /> <br /> But using the search engine, I found Reinos de Sangre here in the list : <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/119375554827464/search/?q=reinos%20de%20sangre\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/groups/1193...%20de%20sangre</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1233-ur-than","name":"Ur-Than","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-14T16:52:32-08:00","id":1503082,"title":"","content":"I second <i>Shadows of Mexico</i>; I never found WoD's regional source-books to be useful or interesting, but that's one's informative! <br /> <br /> As for Spanish; you don't need to be fluent. It would add flavor to the game if you made your maps in Spanish; Rio = River, etc. <br /> <br /> Also, read, &quot;Day in the Life . . .&quot;, books on the time-period your game is set in. You probably won't get Vampire plot-hooks, but you'll understand what your Blood-Supply (Mortals), are doing and how they lived. History books are nice, but they talk about how so-n-so did this and that; great if you're running a game about so-n-so.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}